      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "After writing many scientific articles at the interface of genetics and society, Neil A (Tony) Holtzman published a novel in Autumn 2016: Blame. This book review summarizes several of the story lines, some of which are related to the Inclusion of Diverse Populations in Genomics Research and Health Services, the topic of a special issue of the Journal of Community Genetics."},
